# plans are native seekdb operators over FILE TABLE SCAN
Query Plan
===========================
|ID|OPERATOR         |NAME|
---------------------------
|0 |HASH JOIN        |    |
|1 |├─FILE TABLE SCAN|c   |
|2 |└─FILE TABLE SCAN|o   |
===========================
Outputs & filters:
-------------------------------------
  0 - output([o.order_id], [c.name]), filter(nil), rowset=16
      equal_conds([o.customer_id = c.customer_id]), other_conds(nil)
  1 - output([c.customer_id], [c.name]), filter(nil), rowset=16
      access([c.customer_id], [c.name]), read_json('EXT_DIR/customers.jsonl')
  2 - output([o.customer_id], [o.order_id]), filter(nil), rowset=16
      access([o.customer_id], [o.order_id]), read_csv('EXT_DIR/orders.csv')
